    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p><strong>Frequency </strong>Once per day</p><hr><p><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">You walk the path of iconic figures who came before you, and strive to follow in their footsteps. Roll a Recall Knowledge check using any appropriate knowledge skill you are trained in to recount a saying, proverb, feat, or a historical fact on a prominent figure that’s important to you. This counts as preparing to Aid yourself or an ally within 30 feet of you, but you have ten minutes to provide your aid. When you do, you yell out your recalled fact or saying to empower yourself or your target ally as a free action. The proficiency of the skill you use to Recall Knowledge determines the bonus on a critical success, as normal per Aid.</span></p>"
